 about:{tag:'GET TO KNOW US',title:'MORE THAN A TATTOO STUDIO.',subtitle:'Art, self-expression and a welcoming place in Costa Adeje, Tenerife.',sectionTag:'OUR PHILOSOPHY',sectionTitle:'An idea becomes part of you.',p1:'Welcome to Planta Tattoo Studio, where art meets skin.',p2:'Our studio is a place of creativity and self-expression, where our team of talented tattoo artists is dedicated to turning your vision into stunning body art.',p3:'We take pride in a range of tattoo styles, from intricate black and grey designs to vibrant colour pieces. Each artist brings a unique style and a passion for custom tattoos that tell a story.',p4:'Whether it is your first tattoo or another piece in your collection, we aim to offer a comfortable and professional environment, guiding you through the process.',photoPending:'Studio photographs to be provided by Planta Tattoo',valuesTag:'WHAT MATTERS TO US',valuesTitle:'Art with intention.',values:[['Creativity','Ideas developed around your personal style and inspiration.'],['Connection','Taking the time to understand the tattoo you have in mind.'],['Comfort','An experience built around clear guidance and a welcoming environment.']],historyTag:'THE PLANTA STORY',historyTitle:'Every studio has a story.',history:'The studio’s founding story, dates, and founder profile will appear here once supplied and approved by the client.',pending:'CLIENT CONTENT PENDING',endTitle:'LET’S MAKE SOMETHING PERSONAL.'},
